    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Out of the 5 Sikh Takhts, 3 are in Punjab (Akal Takht Sahib, Damdama Sahib, Keshgarh Sahib), while Patna Sahib is in Bihar and Hazur Sahib is in Maharashtra.",
        "Phulkari embroidery is a GI-tagged craft from Punjab, frequently featured in state and national art & culture questions.",
        "Be prepared to classify Punjabi folk dances by gender: Bhangra, Jhumar, and Luddi (Male); Giddha, Sammi, and Jaago (Female)."
      ],
      "id": "hdzgwr8"
    },
